{"type": "reveal", "fact_id": "PF1", "text": "Good morning, Major. On the used oil, I confirmed this morning that we have exactly 18 drums accepted by the contracted recycling service, with pickup available on 26 June. The contractor confirmation is in the environmental file, but I should note it has not yet been added to the S-4 disposition worksheet. I'll make sure that gets updated. On the vehicle batteries, I don't have a confirmed disposition yet from my end."}
```

